{"seq":2,"slug":"dd-cost-prediction-early-warning","title":"滞箱成本预测、风险评分与提前预警机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/congestion-cost-prediction-operations/dd-cost-prediction-early-warning","wordCount":2943,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"滞箱成本预测-风险评分与提前预警机制\">滞箱成本预测、风险评分与提前预警机制</h1><p>D&amp;D 成本治理里最贵的一句话是「等发票来了再说」。2024 年之后这句话变成了合规风险：美国联邦海事委员会（FMC）的最终规则《Demurrage and Detention Billing Requirements》（FMC Docket 22-08，2024-02-26 公布，2024-05-28 生效，见 federalregister.gov / fmc.gov）给整条计费链装上了硬性时钟——承运人须在费用产生后 30 个日历日内开票，被计费方须在收票后 30 个日历日内提出异议，承运人须在 30 日内答复。三个「30 天」把 D&amp;D 从一门「事后审计」的活，变成了一门「必须提前算准剩余免费期、提前判断哪些箱会超期、提前准备证据」的活。预测不再是加分项，而是争议窗口能否用满的前置条件。</p>\n<p>本文只处理一个问题：如何把「这只箱还能免费放几天、它超期的概率有多大、超了要赔多少钱」做成一列可实时刷新的数字，并在超期发生之前触发运营动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-剩余免费期是唯一必须实时算准的可计算量\">核心概念：剩余免费期是唯一必须实时算准的可计算量</h2><p>预警系统的地基是三个并行时钟的剩余量。D&amp;D 的计时逻辑本身在 <a href=\"../free-time-clock-event-tracking/dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline\"><code>../2_free-time-clock-event-tracking/1_dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline.md</code></a> 里已经建模为事件状态机，这里只取它的输出：对每个时钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>（进口 Demurrage、进口 Detention、出口 Demurrage 等），在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的剩余免费期为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_c(t) = F_c - \\max\\bigl(0,\\ t - s_c\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该时钟的合同免费天数（承运人运价本或 NVOCC 协议给定），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是时钟起算时刻。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 一旦为负，超期天数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_c(t) = t - s_c - F_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就开始按阶梯费率累加。箱级的总风险敞口等于三个时钟的期望超期费之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>D&amp;D</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{D\\&amp;D}_i(t)] = \\sum_{c} \\Pr\\bigl(d_c(t^{+}) &gt; 0\\bigr)\\cdot \\mathbb{E}\\bigl[d_c \\mid d_c &gt; 0\\bigr]\\cdot r_c(d_c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">D&amp;D</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_c(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是阶梯费率函数（多数承运人按「第 1–4 天一个价、第 5 天起翻倍」分段）。这条式子暴露了两个必须分别预测的量：<strong>超期概率</strong>（会不会超）与<strong>超期时长</strong>（超多少）。只预测时长、不预测概率的模型，会在大量「其实能赶上」的箱上浪费运营资源；只预测概率的模型，则算不出钱的量级，无法排优先级。</p>\n<p><code>R_c(t)</code> 的精度完全取决于事件数据的时效。免费的时钟起算点常被误算：免费用箱期没有从「卸船」而是从「货物可提（availability）」起算——这是 FMC 2020 年解释性规则（Docket 19-04，<em>Interpretive Rule on Demurrage and Detention</em>，85 FR 29638，2020-05-18）确立的原则，2026 年 7 月 8 日哥伦比亚特区联邦上诉法院进一步维持了 FMC「滞期费必须促进货物流转」的立场（见 fmc.gov 新闻 2026-07-08）。因此预测系统必须先有一层事件校正，再谈模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特征工程-把码头-船-卡车和海关的信号拼成一行向量\">特征工程：把码头、船、卡车和海关的信号拼成一行向量</h2><p>风险评分的效果，八成来自特征而非算法。可用的信号横跨四个数据域，且它们的可得性差异极大——这决定了模型的可行复杂度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据域</th>\n<th>代表特征</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n<th>时效</th>\n<th>对 D&amp;D 的预测力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>码头作业</td>\n<td>卸船完成、availability、闸口进出、堆场密度</td>\n<td>TOS 直连、承运人 EDI、DCSA Track &amp; Trace</td>\n<td>分钟–小时</td>\n<td>高（直接决定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>船期与港口</td>\n<td>预计靠泊、实际靠泊、泊位等待、跳港、港口拥堵指数</td>\n<td>DCSA Port Call / Operational Vessel Schedules、AIS（MarineTraffic/Spire）</td>\n<td>小时–天</td>\n<td>高（拥堵是超期主因）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海关与合规</td>\n<td>报关放行、查验布控、检验检疫、关税缴纳</td>\n<td>各国单一窗口（IMO FAL 公约 2024-01-01 起强制海事单一窗口）</td>\n<td>小时–天</td>\n<td>中–高（放行晚= Demurrage 主因）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内陆物流</td>\n<td>卡车预约额度、底盘可用性、仓库收货窗口、还箱点容量</td>\n<td>卡车预约平台、承运人箱管系统、仓库 WMS</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>中（Detention 主因）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键工程约束在于：<strong>Detention 侧的特征最不结构化</strong>。Demurrage 有电子闸口记录可依赖，而「还箱点是否拒收空箱」「预约额度是否被抢占」这类事实，往往只存在于邮件和电话记录里（<code>../3_invoice-audit-dispute-recovery/1_dd-invoice-data-model-audit-rules.md</code> 里讨论的证据包问题与此同源）。可行的折中是：把结构化信号（TOS、AIS、海关）喂给模型，把非结构化信号降级为<strong>规则特征</strong>——例如「过去 30 天该还箱点拒收率」这类聚合统计可由运营人员按周维护。</p>\n<p>DCSA 的三套标准——Track &amp; Trace（集装箱事件）、Port Call（港口挂靠数据）、Operational Vessel Schedules（运营船期）——在 dcsa.org/standards 上以开放、厂商中立的模型发布，是跨承运人统一事件字段的事实基准；它们把「每个承运人一套 EDI 字段」的碎片化问题，收敛成可映射到同一张事实表的开放模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风险评分-从规则引擎到可解释的梯度提升\">风险评分：从规则引擎到可解释的梯度提升</h2><p>模型复杂度的选择服从一条经验规律：在特征稀疏、样本偏斜（绝大多数箱不超期）的场景里，<strong>规则引擎 + 逻辑回归</strong>在早期往往优于复杂模型，因为它的输出可以直接向业务解释，且冷启动不需要标注数据。</p>\n<p>规则层先做硬过滤：剩余免费期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_c(t) \\le 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 天、港口拥堵指数超阈值、海关查验布控、船期延误超 48 小时——任一命中即升级为「关注箱」，无需模型介入。这层不追求召回，只保证最明显的风险不被漏掉。</p>\n<p>模型层对落网的箱子给出超期概率。逻辑回归形式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = \\sigma(z_i) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-z_i}}, \\qquad z_i = \\beta_0 + \\sum_{k} \\beta_k x_{ik}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6973em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{ik}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是标准化后的特征（剩余免费天数、堆场密度分位、到港延误天数、报关状态序数、历史同航线超期率等）。当标注数据累积到足以支撑非线性关系时，改用梯度提升树（如 XGBoost/LightGBM）通常能把 AUC 提升若干个百分点，代价是必须额外接一层 SHAP 值来做解释——<strong>在 D&amp;D 场景里解释性不是可选项</strong>：运营人员要凭「为什么这只箱被标红」决定是否花钱改派卡车。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽略的工程细节是<strong>阶梯费率的非线性</strong>。因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_c(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 分段跳变，把「超期 1 天」与「超期 5 天」当成同一标签训练会严重低估后者。可行的做法是把目标从「是否超期」改成「期望超期费用」，用回归而非分类直接拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>D&amp;D</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{D\\&amp;D}_i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">D&amp;D</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，再在阈值层做运营切分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"提前预警-把分数变成有截止时间的运营动作\">提前预警：把分数变成有截止时间的运营动作</h2><p>预警机制的核心不是「发通知」，而是「在正确的提前量上、把动作交到正确的角色手里」。提前量必须由干预的物理提前期反向推导：改派卡车需要 1 天、申请延长免费期需要 2–3 天、安排内陆转运需要 2 天，因此预警的黄金窗口是超期前 3–5 天——<strong>这与 FMC 2024 规则给异议留出的 30 天窗口是两回事：后者是事后合规时钟，前者是事前干预时钟。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[事件流写入 TOS/EDI/AIS/海关] --&gt; B[三时钟剩余免费期 R_c(t) 刷新]&#10;  B --&gt; C{R_c(t) &lt;= 预警阈值?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[常规监控 每日刷新]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[风险评分模型 输出 E[D&amp;D_i]]&#10;  E --&gt; F{期望费用 &gt; 阈值?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| G[低风险 记录不动作]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[按角色分层派单]&#10;  H --&gt; I[卡车调度&lt;br/&gt;改派/加急预约]&#10;  H --&gt; J[关务&lt;br/&gt;跟进放行/查验]&#10;  H --&gt; K[采购/客服&lt;br/&gt;申请延长免费期]&#10;  H --&gt; L[证据采集&lt;br/&gt;为可能的争议留档]&#10;  I --&gt; M[干预结果回写 用于反事实与模型再训练]&#10;  J --&gt; M&#10;  K --&gt; M&#10;  L --&gt; M\">graph TD\n  A[事件流写入 TOS/EDI/AIS/海关] --&gt; B[三时钟剩余免费期 R_c(t) 刷新]\n  B --&gt; C{R_c(t) &lt;= 预警阈值?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[常规监控 每日刷新]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[风险评分模型 输出 E[D&amp;D_i]]\n  E --&gt; F{期望费用 &gt; 阈值?}\n  F --&gt;|否| G[低风险 记录不动作]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[按角色分层派单]\n  H --&gt; I[卡车调度&lt;br/&gt;改派/加急预约]\n  H --&gt; J[关务&lt;br/&gt;跟进放行/查验]\n  H --&gt; K[采购/客服&lt;br/&gt;申请延长免费期]\n  H --&gt; L[证据采集&lt;br/&gt;为可能的争议留档]\n  I --&gt; M[干预结果回写 用于反事实与模型再训练]\n  J --&gt; M\n  K --&gt; M\n  L --&gt; M</pre><p>分层规则可按期望费用设定三档：低档仅记录、中档通知运营、高档触发跨角色协同并自动开启证据采集。证据采集要<strong>在超期发生前</strong>启动，因为 FMC 规则下的豁免主张依赖「货物不可提」的证据链（堆场未备妥、海关未放行、预约无法获得），而这些证据在事后往往无法补录。把预警系统与争议证据包打通，是把预测转化为实际回收的关键接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预测精度度量与模型运营\">预测精度度量与模型运营</h2><p>D&amp;D 预测的评估指标必须区分两类错误，因为它们的成本极不对称。漏报（本该预警却未预警）直接变成罚金；误报（预警了却没超期）只浪费运营人力。因此主指标应是<strong>在固定预警容量下的召回率</strong>（例如「每天最多派 200 单，这 200 单覆盖了多少实际超期费用」），而非单纯的 AUC 或准确率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>费用加权召回</td>\n<td>被预警箱覆盖的实际超期费用 / 全部超期费用</td>\n<td>主指标，直接对应节约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预警精确率</td>\n<td>被预警箱中真超期的比例</td>\n<td>控制运营人力浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提前量分布</td>\n<td>预警触发时刻到超期时刻的天数分布</td>\n<td>验证是否给出足够干预时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期望费用 MAE</td>\n<td>$</td>\n<td>E[\\text{D&amp;D}] - \\text{实际}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分航线/分港口偏差</td>\n<td>各分组上的系统性高估/低估</td>\n<td>捕捉模型漂移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>模型运营上，最有价值的做法是<strong>反事实记录</strong>：预警触发时记录「若不干预的预测费用」，干预完成后记录「实际费用」，两者之差即该次预警的净收益。这批数据既用于证明系统 ROI，也用于再训练时纠正「干预后必然不超期」带来的选择性偏差——如果不记录干预标记，模型会把「已干预」的样本当成「本来就不会超期」，逐步高估自身精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从预测到节约-干预选择与边界\">从预测到节约：干预选择与边界</h2><p>预测的价值只在干预能改变结果时成立。对一只剩余 1 天、卡车预约在 3 天后的箱子，预警本身不省钱；能省钱的是「加急预约」这个动作。因此系统必须能计算每个候选干预的净收益：干预成本（加急费、改派费、仓储费）与回避的期望 D&amp;D 费用之差。只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>回避的 </mtext><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>D&amp;D</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>干预成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{回避的 } E[\\text{D\\&amp;D}] &gt; \\text{干预成本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回避的</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">D&amp;D</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">干预成本</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时才建议执行——这条判据把预警从「尽最大努力提醒」变成「按期望收益排序的资源配置」。</p>\n<p>需要明确系统的能力边界。预测无法改变码头拥堵本身，也无法在承运人拒绝延长免费期时凭空创造时间；它只能优化<strong>货方能控的那部分</strong>——提箱时机、预约安排、报关前置、还箱路径选择。把它限定在「货方可控变量的排序器」上，才是它在成本治理体系中的真实位置：它消费上游的时钟与事件，输出下游的干预指令，并把每次干预的结果沉淀回模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>D&amp;D 成本预测的骨架是三步：先把三个并行时钟的剩余免费期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 算准（依赖事件数据的时效与起算点校正），再用可解释模型给出超期概率与期望费用，最后把分数按干预的物理提前期转成有截止时间的派单。三个「30 天」合规时钟（FMC 2024 规则）划定了事后窗口，而超期前 3–5 天才是干预黄金窗口——两套时钟不能混用。系统只优化货方可控变量，其最终价值由「干预成本 &lt; 回避的期望 D&amp;D」这一判据和反事实记录共同度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>时钟建模与事件状态机的基础：<a href=\"../free-time-clock-event-tracking/dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline\"><code>../2_free-time-clock-event-tracking/1_dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline.md</code></a></li>\n<li>预测触发的证据采集如何接入争议流程：<a href=\"../invoice-audit-dispute-recovery/dd-invoice-data-model-audit-rules\"><code>../3_invoice-audit-dispute-recovery/1_dd-invoice-data-model-audit-rules.md</code></a></li>\n<li>费率、免费期与合同条款的结构化定义：<a href=\"../dd-charge-regime-commercial-model/carrier-tariff-free-time-contract-terms\"><code>../1_dd-charge-regime-commercial-model/2_carrier-tariff-free-time-contract-terms.md</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"滞箱成本预测、风险评分与提前预警机制","id":"滞箱成本预测-风险评分与提前预警机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：剩余免费期是唯一必须实时算准的可计算量","id":"核心概念-剩余免费期是唯一必须实时算准的可计算量"},{"level":2,"text":"特征工程：把码头、船、卡车和海关的信号拼成一行向量","id":"特征工程-把码头-船-卡车和海关的信号拼成一行向量"},{"level":2,"text":"风险评分：从规则引擎到可解释的梯度提升","id":"风险评分-从规则引擎到可解释的梯度提升"},{"level":2,"text":"提前预警：把分数变成有截止时间的运营动作","id":"提前预警-把分数变成有截止时间的运营动作"},{"level":2,"text":"预测精度度量与模型运营","id":"预测精度度量与模型运营"},{"level":2,"text":"从预测到节约：干预选择与边界","id":"从预测到节约-干预选择与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"拥堵驱动因素与港口队列/停留时长度量模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/congestion-cost-prediction-operations/congestion-drivers-port-dwell-model"},"next":{"title":"滞箱成本治理 KPI、考核与跨方协同运营手册","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/congestion-cost-prediction-operations/dd-kpi-governance-ops-playbook"}}